    "question": {
      ":question/id": "484acd94-c2fa-59d1-badc-43bca10317fb",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following is a $4\\times 2$ matrix?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- The matrix $L$ has $4$ rows and $2$ columns. So, its dimensions are $4\\times 2.$ $\\,\\checkmark$\n\n- The matrix $M$ has $4$ rows and $1$ column. So, its dimensions are $4\\times 1.$ $\\,\\times$\n\n- The matrix $N$ has $4$ rows and $2$ columns. So, its dimensions are $4\\times 2.$ $\\,\\checkmark$\n\nTherefore, only $L$ and $N$ are $4\\times 2$ matrices.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "e41c6e6a-f0ac-5c2e-be3c-3f8e4db97797",
