      ":question/problem": "Which of the following is a $1\\times 4$ matrix?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- The matrix $E$ has $3$ rows and $4$ columns. So, its dimensions are $3\\times 4.$ $\\,\\times$\n\n- The matrix $F$ has $1$ row and $4$ columns. So, its dimensions are $1\\times 4.$ $\\,\\checkmark$\n\n- The matrix $G$ has $3$ rows and $4$ columns. So, its dimensions are $3\\times 4.$ $\\,\\times$\n\nTherefore, only $F$ is a $1\\times 4$ matrix.",
